# ============================================================
# NET-27.CC → NET27.WATCH  |  301 Permanent Redirect
# All traffic from old domain redirects to new domain.
# ============================================================

# Root
https://net-27.cc/ https://net27.watch/ 301

# All pages with path — preserves URL structure
https://net-27.cc/* https://net27.watch/:splat 301

# www variant
https://www.net-27.cc/ https://net27.watch/ 301
https://www.net-27.cc/* https://net27.watch/:splat 301

# HTTP (non-HTTPS) — for Google's crawler which tries http://
http://net-27.cc/ https://net27.watch/ 301
http://net-27.cc/* https://net27.watch/:splat 301
http://www.net-27.cc/ https://net27.watch/ 301
http://www.net-27.cc/* https://net27.watch/:splat 301

# ============================================================
# WWW.NET27.WATCH → NET27.WATCH | 301 Permanent Redirect
# Consolidate www traffic into canonical non-www domain
# ============================================================
https://www.net27.watch/ https://net27.watch/ 301
https://www.net27.watch/* https://net27.watch/:splat 301
http://www.net27.watch/ https://net27.watch/ 301
http://www.net27.watch/* https://net27.watch/:splat 301